36
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:32,240
And then there's a basic principle.

37
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:34,360
So this is called the law of large numbers.

38
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:36,160
You've probably heard about it.

39
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:38,400
But it says that random errors tend to cancel each other out

40
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,960
in percentage terms.

41
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:40,920
Percentage terms is important.

42
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:44,760
And elections are generally won in percentage terms.

43
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,280
So, nice.

44
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:49,160
And what this means, according to people

45
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:51,400
