choice, saying, well, if there is a government failure, it's a failure that the government

48
01:02:42,540 --> 01:02:43,540
is too small.

49
01:02:43,540 --> 01:02:47,540
And this is just going back to the Akerlof-Levins model.

50
01:02:47,540 --> 01:02:56,620
So the normal populist view of used car markets is that there's dumb purchasers and there's

51
01:02:56,620 --> 01:02:59,740
crafty sellers, and the sellers go and say, oh, it's a great car.

52
01:02:59,740 --> 01:03:00,740
Trust me, Grandma.

53
01:03:00,740 --> 01:03:01,740
And Grandma says, is it really?

54
01:03:01,740 --> 01:03:02,740
And they go, yes, Grandma.

55
01:03:02,740 --> 01:03:03,740
OK.

56
01:03:03,740 --> 01:03:04,740
