57
01:03:04,740 --> 01:03:05,740
And then the car breaks down a mile away.

58
01:03:05,740 --> 01:03:06,740
And then she calls them up.

59
01:03:06,740 --> 01:03:07,740
They say, sorry, there's no warranty.

60
01:03:07,740 --> 01:03:08,740
Easy come, easy go.

61
01:03:08,740 --> 01:03:09,740
Bye, Grandma.

62
01:03:09,740 --> 01:03:16,860
So anyway, that's the usual story, but that's not the Akerlof story.

63
01:03:16,860 --> 01:03:19,740
The Akerlof story is of a Grandma with common sense.

64
01:03:19,740 --> 01:03:20,740
You're just trying to see.

65
01:03:20,740 --> 01:03:21,740
You're just tricking me.

66
01:03:21,740 --> 01:03:22,740
What proof have you got?

67
01:03:22,740 --> 01:03:25,740
Let me see the warranty, sonny.

68
01:03:25,740 --> 01:03:31,660
Or maybe Grandma just says, at my age, I can't figure out anything anymore, so I'm just going

69
01:03:31,660 --> 01:03:33,220
