88
01:04:33,460 --> 01:04:35,460
It's going to be hard.

89
01:04:35,460 --> 01:04:41,460
You say, look, I've got a new drug, it's going to cost $10 million, and it will save a billion

90
01:04:41,460 --> 01:04:44,460
dollars in taxpayer money a year, just give me the money.

91
01:04:44,460 --> 01:04:46,460
