96
01:04:59,460 --> 01:05:03,460
No, no, no, really, like seriously, I mean, you just go and take the classes and read

97
01:05:03,460 --> 01:05:06,460
the report, it's fine, whatever, no, no.

98
01:05:06,460 --> 01:05:07,460
Right?

99
01:05:07,460 --> 01:05:09,460
And that's the problem.

