136
01:06:39,460 --> 01:06:40,460
Yeah.

137
01:06:40,460 --> 01:06:41,460
We've got money for the elderly, don't we?

138
01:06:41,460 --> 01:06:42,460
Yeah.

139
01:06:42,460 --> 01:06:43,460
All right.

140
01:06:43,460 --> 01:06:44,460
We've got money for everyone we like.

141
01:06:44,460 --> 01:06:45,460
Yeah.

142
01:06:45,460 --> 01:06:48,460
All right, and that's much closer to an actual presidential election.

143
01:06:48,460 --> 01:06:51,460
But anyway, Whitman will just look at that and say, well, obviously people don't feel

