01:08:32,460 --> 01:08:34,460
Lack of common sense.

183
01:08:34,460 --> 01:08:37,460
You want to say, well, they've got a bunch of particular little issues here.

184
01:08:37,460 --> 01:08:44,460
You don't want to just go full anti-humanity and just say, human beings are intellectually

185
01:08:44,460 --> 01:08:45,460
weak.

186
01:08:45,460 --> 01:08:56,460
They are really, we'll just go with the source and rattle off the names.

187
01:08:56,460 --> 01:08:58,460
They are doofy fools.

