01:12:20,460 --> 01:12:27,460
Well, I don't see what you're talking about. If this were really a problem, rational voters would just very harshly punished, proceed violations,

251
01:12:27,460 --> 01:12:35,460
and this would make politicians very frightened of doing anything the voters don't want, and that would solve the problem.

252
01:12:35,460 --> 01:12:39,460
So that is the story that he has in mind.

253
01:12:39,460 --> 01:12:44,460
And if you say, what about that cruel and unusual punishment clause in the Constitution that would prevent us from, say,

