01:13:39,460 --> 01:13:40,460
Looks like it's cruel and.

266
01:13:40,460 --> 01:13:48,460
Yeah, yeah. So by the letter of the law, you can do, if there are common but very cruel punishments, they're totally fine.

267
01:13:48,460 --> 01:13:56,460
All right. Now, that's not the way the Supreme Court has interpreted the word and in recent years in this case.

268
01:13:56,460 --> 01:13:58,460
But who's to blame for that?

269
01:13:58,460 --> 01:14:04,460
I don't know if I see this.

270
01:14:04,460 --> 01:14:11,460
All right. So anyway, Whitman says is, look, you know, politicians can and have destroyed their whole careers over one little mistake.

271
01:14:11,460 --> 01:14:17,460
