01:79:15,600 --> 01:79:17,560
But that's fine.

528
01:79:17,560 --> 01:79:18,480
That's fine.

529
01:79:18,480 --> 01:79:20,680
We should assume extreme voter stupidity,

530
01:79:20,680 --> 01:79:23,280
because voters are extremely stupid.

531
