01:79:58,160 --> 01:80:21,520
An engineer should be entitled to a good house.


1
01:80:00,000 --> 01:80:05,000
My dad was an engineer, so he was a beaver about the proper hierarchy of the world.

2
01:80:05,000 --> 01:80:08,000
I was tempted to say, well, what should be done for this engineer?

3
01:80:08,000 --> 01:80:12,000
